### 5b.3 Lima Linux Runner 设计要点

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  macOS host(M5)                                            │
│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │
│  │  docker compose:                                      │ │
│  │   postgres · redis · dex · minio · registry          │ │
│  │   caddy · otel-collector · proxy · ssh-gateway        │ │
│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │
│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │
│  │  host process:                                        │ │
│  │   yarn nx serve api      (NestJS, hot reload)        │ │
│  │   yarn nx serve dashboard (Vite, hot reload)         │ │
│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │
│           │ HTTPS via Caddy *.boxlite.test                 │
│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │
│  │  Lima VM(ubuntu, aarch64, vz driver):              │ │
│  │   /dev/kvm 可用                                       │ │
│  │   runner-1, runner-2, ... (动态 limactl 起停)        │ │
│  │    │                                                  │ │
│  │    └─ 跑真 microVM (libkrun + KVM)                   │ │
│  │       └─ daemon as PID 1 (Toolbox API)                │ │
│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

# LimaInfraProvider 调用
provisionRunner({ name: "runner-3", ... })
  └─ shell: limactl start --name runner-3 \
              --set ".cpus = 2 | .memory = '4GiB'" \
              boxlite-runner.yaml
  └─ in Lima: scp runner binary + systemd unit
  └─ poll: until runner /health returns 200
  └─ register: POST /admin/runners 拿到 token
  └─ return { id, apiUrl: "http://<lima-internal-ip>:3003" }

terminateRunner(runnerId)
  └─ shell: limactl stop runner-3
  └─ shell: limactl delete runner-3
```

**关键依赖**(开发机预装):
- Docker Desktop (Apple Silicon, ≥ 4.30)
- Lima(`brew install lima`)+ 一个预配 image(`brew install qemu` 不需要,vz driver 即可)
- mkcert(`brew install mkcert` + `mkcert -install`)
- yarn 4(Corepack `corepack enable`)
- Go 1.25 + Rust(已有,做 runner 与 libkrun 用)

**预编译产物**(Lima image 里拉的):
- `boxlite-runner` 二进制(Linux arm64,本地 `cargo build` 出来,可用 `BOXLITE_DEPS_STUB=1` 加速)
- `boxlite-daemon` 二进制(Linux arm64)
- libkrun 共享库

### 5b.4 验证脚本(`apps/infra-local/scripts/smoke.sh` 补强)

```bash
#!/bin/bash
# 完整 smoke test —— 跑通就算 M0 交付
set -euo pipefail

# 1. 起底层服务
docker compose -f apps/infra-local/compose.local.yml up -d

# 2. 起 host 服务
yarn nx serve api &
yarn nx serve dashboard &
wait-on http://localhost:3000/health http://localhost:5173

# 3. 启动一台 Lima runner
boxlite-cli admin runner provision lima --name runner-1

# 4. 创建一个 box
TOKEN=$(boxlite-cli auth login --api-key=$BOXLITE_API_KEY)
BOX=$(boxlite-cli box create --image alpine:3.22 --json)
boxlite-cli box exec $BOX -- echo "hello from boxlite"
boxlite-cli box delete $BOX

# 5. 触发 autoscaler scale-up(造容量压力)
for i in {1..20}; do boxlite-cli box create --image alpine:3.22 & done
wait
# 验证 autoscaler 起了第二台 Lima
sleep 90
LIMA_COUNT=$(limactl list | grep -c "boxlite-runner")
[[ $LIMA_COUNT -ge 2 ]] || { echo "scale-up failed"; exit 1; }

# 6. 清理
boxlite-cli box delete --all
sleep 900  # 等 scale-down cron
LIMA_COUNT=$(limactl list | grep -c "boxlite-runner")
[[ $LIMA_COUNT -le 1 ]] || { echo "scale-down failed"; exit 1; }

echo "✓ Full local dev smoke passed"
```

